  "id": "cedefop-kivet-3070b",
  "title": "Medium/high-qualified employment (% of total in the age group of 20-64 years olds)",
  "description": "Share of total employment accounted for by individuals with medium- (ISCED 3-4) or high-level (ISCED 5 and above) qualifications. Calculations are specific for the age group 20-64. Level of qualifications refers to the educational attainment of individuals who are employed and not to the educational requirements of their jobs. (Cedefop calculations based on Eurostat data, LFS).",
